<title>USA: Ballard Medical acquires oral hygiene co.</title>
<headline>Ballard Medical acquires oral hygiene co.</headline>
<dateline>DRAPER, Utah 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ballard Medical Products said on Tuesday that it had acquired  Plastic Engineered Products Co of Canal Fulton, Ohio for for $4.5 million of Ballard common shares.</p>
<p>Plastic Engineered is a manufacturer of oral hygiene products for critically ill patients.</p>
